  "prefLabel": "Plc 1605.06 Initial Review of Renewal Applications",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1605.06 Initial Review of Renewal Applications. Within 30 days of receipt of an application for registration renewal submitted pursuant to Plc 1605.03, the licensing bureau shall process the application as provided in Plc 308.09.\n\nSource. #13914, eff 5-6-24",
